From 93306e337d96e028eabcbcdb05115ff16970acea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Josh Rodd <josh@rodd.us>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 09:50:22 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add memdump server for external guest memory observation

Add a TCP memory-dump server (src/memdump.c) so external tools can poll
guest memory (e.g. the text framebuffer) without a debugger attach.

- memdump_port setting under [General] (0 = disabled, the default),
  loaded and saved by the config system
- memdump_init()/memdump_close() hooks in machine_init() and pc_close()

Assisted-by: oh-my-pi:glm-5.3
